OL,3,ABurnham's summer tour is over - now he
OL,4,Ahas to prove himself in Parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is set to come under the
OL,7,Fmost intense scrutiny of his political
OL,8,Flife when Parliament returns on
OL,9,FTuesday.
OL,11,FSince coming to power six weeks ago,
OL,12,Fthe new prime minister has largely been
OL,13,Ffree to set his own agenda.
OL,15,FThe timing of Labour's leadership
OL,16,Fcontest meant he walked into Number 10
OL,17,Fafter the House of Commons began its
OL,18,Fsummer break, denying MPs the chance to
OL,19,Fquestion him and creating what some
OL,20,Fhave seen as a honeymoon period.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
